Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An actual elephant bluefin tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't wait to cook it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... the air. The air?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's on the execution platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old man said this is the\Nplace where it all happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king of the pirates\Nwas executed right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's there now? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were watching the square as you had\Nordered and he just showed up out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Flash-A-Lay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, he finally showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took him long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:01:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what the King of\Nthe Pirates saw when he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me, Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.69,0:01:13.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,200)\fs35}Editing{\r}\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,200)\fs35}Timing{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attained this and everything\Nelse the world had to offer.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Quality Control{\r}\NFeeso\NGalaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NSewil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.69,0:01:21.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Soundtracking{\r}\NHalee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.69,0:01:23.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Graphics{\r}\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.69,0:01:25.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Karaoke{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.69,0:01:27.69,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Translation{\r}\NGaijin\NFUNimation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.67,0:02:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.\NIf you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are Hey, you up there!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.30,0:03:06.18,Title-480p,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)}The Legend Has Begun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down from there immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are standing on an execution platform\Nthat belongs to the world government!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get down from there right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time for such trifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's just rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to tell me\Nthat you, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have forgotten my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's absolutely gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such pure beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her skin looks so deliciously soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For God, I'm pretty sure\Nwe haven't ever met?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the first man who\Never truly struck me! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:03:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you struck me with\Nyour passionate fist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would all of you say is the most\Nbeautiful sight in the whole East Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am quite breathtaking, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a man alive who\Nwouldn't crumble before my beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I prefer strong men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.97,0:04:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you all\Nmine, Luffy. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, gross. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your weapon down and come quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am placing you under arrest\Nfor assaulting a police captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you up there, get\Noff that platform. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did you say you were arresting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a big problem here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't give a damn. Arrest her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just stand here and look at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A terror is bombing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It slipped right past her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little stunt was dangerous, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm flashily sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your smooth skin is unharmed, of\Ncourse, so there's no need for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fairest Alvida.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alvida?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see Alvida.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so dense, you nimwit! I'm Alvida!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think you're her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I really did change\Nafter eating the fruit called...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smooth, smooth fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:06:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No attack can hurt my skin\Nbecause it slides right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, a lowly fruit couldn't\Nimprove upon my already stunning good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One big change you may have noticed\Nwas that I lost my freckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, that must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After becoming a whole new person, I\Ndecided to join forces with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who shared my goal of finding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've flashily made my entrance,\Nbehold the real star of the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever since the day you sent me flying,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been obsessed with\Nexacting my revenge on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That alone led me to\Nfinally finding my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My travels are an epic saga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went through hell, found friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even lost parts of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call this tale Tiny\NBuggy's Great Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first thing that happened was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell am I telling you a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy, Boogie, Beehe, Baggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Babanuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buffoon, you got a lot of\Nnerve, you rubber bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now Back the Clown is\Ngoing to make you pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Back the Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Buggy Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You people flashily stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want every single one of you to\Nsee exactly how scary I can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, buggy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you just now remembered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, you rubber freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's your pal, Roronoa Zoro? Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, Cabaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To all of my followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:08:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hundreds of billions of\Nthem around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will now superflashily\Nbegin the public execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trapped, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't move so much as an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Straw Hat, feel honored?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die in the same place\Nas the King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barometric pressure is falling fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a sharp drop before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought I\Nfelt something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.03,0:08:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a storm headed\Nstraight for the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'd better hurry back to\Nthe ship or we'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it gonna be big? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you guys seen him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Buggy the Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they said Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then what well sir\Nit isn't just Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,luffy it's also buggy\Nthe clown and iron club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alvida they're all there\Nwanted pirates from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.85,0:09:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the east blue have taken\Nover our town square.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they do all of this\Nright in front of me why
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those arrogant scumbags\Ncaptain smoker sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are your orders? Send\NUnit #1 out to the sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have unit number two surround\Nthe pirates from the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rest will stand by within\Nshooting range of the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see that it's done sir and\Ngive this order to unit one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.53,0:09:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are to crush any pirate\Nships as soon as they see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't want a single\None of those wretched
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates to get off this\Nisland not a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,execution buggy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cloud who's gonna kill straw?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had Luffy, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna execute him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.99,0:10:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freaking idiot. Let's go. Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And treat it like a lady, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.87,0:10:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where we going, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.21,0:10:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The harbor, you numbskull. Harbor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I didn't know any\Nbetter, I would say that Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is about to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, we are ready to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One pirate is about to kill another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them fight it out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll save us the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:11:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once that Straw Hat loses his head, we\Nsurround Buggy, Alvida, and their gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy of the Straw Hats\Nwill be flashily executed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the crime of being stuck\Nup and making me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not living out flashily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, I've never seen an execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're about to, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I hereby flashily begin the\Nfestivities of this public execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a massive cumulus\Ncloud in the eastern sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means an unimaginably big storm is\Nheaded our way and it's coming in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Buggy and Luffy have caused a scene,\Nthe Marines are sure to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if our ship is washed out to sea\Nwhen we need to escape, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the Marines have\Nalready started taking action,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they'll destroy the Going\NMary if they find it. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.61,0:12:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me the\NGoing Mary's in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nami, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, men, double time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riding around on a Richie bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who, who, who's that man\Nriding around on a Luffy bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the rubber\Nguy's ship, huh? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a bigger ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't need it where he's going,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because it's almost time for\NBuggy to flashily finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just in case the rubber guy, who has\Nabsolutely no chance of escaping,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need to burn this ship down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burning wood smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I spare your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what happens\Nwhen you go against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it for the man I had my eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got quite a big\Naudience here today. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to say a few\Nwords before you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, cat got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay quiet or say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the man who'll be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the man who'll be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this town of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a crazy thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally getting to\Nthe best part of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Pirate Hunter Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it, Zoro, but you're\Njust a little bit too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna break down the platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brain, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, boys, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even the Great Zoro can stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you two can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end for your captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just cut down the platform...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's head falls, we\Nall attack together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for battle, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, hurry up! Nami! Heavy! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was divine intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our troubles are not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surround all the pirates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.82,0:17:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody here went crazy so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry back to the Going Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or we'll never be able\Nto leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we sure as hell won't\Nget to the Grand Round.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Skrull Head gang is getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he know he'd be saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, he was certain\Nthat his life was about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He simply accepted death and\Nsmiled after preparing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, we have to pursue the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:18:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen any pirates who\Nsmiled on the execution platform?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how tough the guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the moment of death, they all\Nturn pale and die in despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat man smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.23,0:18:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He smiled just like\NGold Roger 22 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like the old king of the pirates did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On that exact execution platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain where's the\NStraw Hat man now sir he
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slipped past us and is\Nheading towards the harbor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.11,0:18:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unit 1 should have\Ndestroyed their ship by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, they had to return\Nto port for a refitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, they couldn't light their\Npowder due to the sudden rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a reserve unit is currently making\Npreparations to attack the ship instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, if we let them sail now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll be able to get to the Grand\NLine before we can capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing towards the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tailwind for that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this just mere coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if heaven itself has\Nspecial plans for this young pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better picket the\Npace or we're toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am White Hunter Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.17,0:19:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On my honor as Marine Captain, I\Nwon't let that man leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with all this rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami was right about this storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get back to\Nthe ship and set sail soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to be stuck here for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time,\Nyou silly little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anybody alive who can lay\Na hand on this perfectly smooth skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:19:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.75,0:20:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a field of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, you're not\Nfried to a crisp! I don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sending Marines from Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, I don't care, they\Ncan stick their noses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me say noses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.41,0:20:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, my bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We go after that little rubber twerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moji and Richie are burning\Nhis ship as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he's got no place he can run to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so all that's left for us to do\Nis do what Buggy pirates do best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick his ass! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha! Motor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bomb engine, ignite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set the ramp, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right track is set!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No friction!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.07,0:20:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smooth, smooth track!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:21:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let those pirates escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did the smoke come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whiteout time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't waste my time\Nwith you little fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.67,0:21:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the power of\Nthe Plum Plum Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took out Buggy's entire\Ncrew just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoker, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't break free of\Nthis horrible steel net.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd they get a gun like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.99,0:21:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cage shot developed by the Marines\Nto deal with Devil Fruit powers. Cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get the Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.87,0:21:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring my billower pipe. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to start storming now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to burn\Ndown this ship when it's wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, Richie,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're gonna get in big trouble if we\Ncan't get a fire going in this rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.01,0:22:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, Richie. I'll feed you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.47,0:22:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't the little thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.11,0:22:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.57,0:22:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack, fresh egg star!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn brain, it made my hand slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.13,0:22:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.77,0:23:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Moji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.67,0:23:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a proud buggy pirate, and I won't let\Nyou get anywhere near this stupid ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.73,0:23:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.95,0:23:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go contact the cannon unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.31,0:23:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to capture this pirate vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.35,0:23:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.11,0:23:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way is this sea? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain makes it hard to\Ntell where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.11,0:23:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.23,0:23:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, they're like roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.73,0:23:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to stop and fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.27,0:24:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were\NZoro and a pirate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found one right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.43,0:24:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just another liar! Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.71,0:24:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.61,0:24:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never asked me what\Nmy name was, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.91,0:24:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I never lied, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.49,0:24:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know there's no way\NI'm going to allow someone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.95,0:24:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like you to leave town with\Nsuch a legendary sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wado Ichimonji! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.83,0:24:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.59,0:24:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.07,0:24:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fight a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:24:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.25,0:24:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, if you hurt her,\NI'm gonna kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.61,0:24:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshigi's got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to disappoint, but you\Nwill never get this sword from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.35,0:25:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.49,0:25:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her lose before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.71,0:25:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I think it's time for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.19,0:25:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.15,0:25:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.77,0:25:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.29,0:25:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being born as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.91,0:25:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic that you can't\Nfight me because I'm a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.99,0:25:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.09,0:25:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be physically stronger,\Nbut you don't have the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.33,0:25:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sword isn't just for decoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even think you know\Nwhat it means to carry a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up for one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.21,0:26:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you got the same face as some\Ngirl I knew who died a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.97,0:26:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and before I know a thing about\Nyou, you're talking just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.53,0:26:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want you to do is stop acting like\Nsome dead person you don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.87,0:26:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And try to be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.83,0:26:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.57,0:26:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault I sound\Nlike your dead girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.99,0:26:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea it was so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.79,0:26:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thoughtless of me to be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ever think before you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.45,0:26:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.23,0:26:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.63,0:26:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The harbor is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.79,0:26:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.77,0:26:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.79,0:27:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.99,0:27:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.15,0:27:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.47,0:27:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These unstoppable ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.11,0:27:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are held deep in the heart of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.35,0:27:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.23,0:27:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.73,0:27:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pirate King, fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.75,0:27:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Smoker of the Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.15,0:27:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm in charge of keeping\Nthe peace in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.77,0:27:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest.\NHuh? Arrest? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I'm going to the Grand Lines so\Nthat I can become King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.75,0:27:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.25,0:27:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I refuse to get arrested in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.83,0:27:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.81,0:27:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.13,0:27:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, I'll be right there. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.43,0:28:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.13,0:28:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay here even a minute longer,\Nthe Going Mary will be done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.75,0:28:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't set sail yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.45,0:28:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others aren't back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.31,0:28:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.99,0:28:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, she'll be sunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.93,0:28:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brightwater, fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.81,0:28:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the rest of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.73,0:28:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll pick them up later!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.49,0:28:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.75,0:28:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After them! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.31,0:28:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.01,0:28:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.03,0:28:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up, I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.49,0:28:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.21,0:29:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just get them later!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.47,0:29:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.42,0:29:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is endless!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.67,0:29:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.43,0:29:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way that we can take\Nthe ship back against this current!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.15,0:29:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.83,0:29:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.15,0:29:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saint, ooze up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.51,0:29:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.39,0:29:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ate the gluten gluten fruit so my\Nbody can be smoked whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.87,0:30:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.53,0:30:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.57,0:30:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.65,0:30:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kathleen!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.11,0:30:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap, that's really gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.29,0:30:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn now, smoke screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.27,0:30:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.11,0:30:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dom-dom-pesta!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.51,0:30:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.95,0:31:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to go through me\Nto get to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.89,0:31:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.75,0:31:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not worth 30 million\Nberries. Your luck's run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.37,0:31:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure about that it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.71,0:31:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.27,0:31:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the government can have your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.35,0:31:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is still waiting for our answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.55,0:32:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.87,0:32:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.27,0:32:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.33,0:32:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.87,0:32:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship will be gone soon. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.73,0:32:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.89,0:32:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.59,0:32:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.69,0:32:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.53,0:33:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.05,0:33:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was certainly a\Nflashy gust of wind for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.77,0:33:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never been one to turn\Ndown luck that's in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.39,0:33:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we headed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.87,0:33:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy will face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.91,0:33:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nowhere he can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.67,0:33:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't stop till the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.81,0:33:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.72,0:33:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, then by\Nall means make your dream happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.57,0:33:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you help that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.51,0:33:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.09,0:33:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not our place to come between\Nthat man and his chosen path, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.11,0:34:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.59,0:34:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going after him. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.13,0:34:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll enter the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.13,0:34:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Captain, you can't\Nabandon your post on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.81,0:34:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this island what would\Ncommand say tell them i Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.85,0:34:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care about orders i'm\Ncoming with you sergeant
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.11,0:34:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,major tashigi i have to\Nhunt down roba noah Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.81,0:34:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's mine. I will get revenge. It\Nlooks like she wants to capsize!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.03,0:34:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! A light!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.97,0:34:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a lighthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.53,0:34:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of the guideposts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the Grand\NLine is somewhere ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.91,0:34:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is somewhere\Njust out ahead. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.85,0:34:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we have to go there in the middle\Nof a frickin' hurricane like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.57,0:35:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I think we should say\Nsomething to mark the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.27,0:35:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.03,0:35:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.01,0:35:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the Grand\NLine to find the all blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.71,0:35:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.01,0:35:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's best swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.81,0:35:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going so I can draw a\Nmap of the entire world?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.81,0:35:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.63,0:35:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be a brave warrior on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.13,0:35:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, to the Grand Line!

